  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Peaceful Cohabitation between the Communities of Logone Birni in the Far North of Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to contribute to the strengthening of peaceful cohabitation among the communities of Logone Birni in the Far North region in Cameroon, and in particular among communities that show signs of constant or increasing conflict related to competition over natural resources, livelihoods and based on the historical and socio-political conflictual context of the area.</narrative>
  </description>
